  triage:title "The REQ-SAG-0135 acceptance row requires the clap rows to 'pass in CI for both l" ;
  triage:description "The REQ-SAG-0135 acceptance row requires the clap rows to 'pass in CI for both libraries'. The developer report lists 'Remote CI not yet exercised for the new jobs' as a deferral. The `deps`, `wheel` and `workspace-tests` jobs are wired but have no recorded green run on PR #31. This criterion cannot be confirmed from repository evidence alone, so it is not-verifiable. Recommendation: Run the PR CI and record green results for the `deps` (cargo tree gates, check-exact-pins), `wheel` and `workspace-tests` jobs. Fix any job that fails. The finding clears when the CI evidence is attached to the PR." ;
